{"seq":2,"slug":"knots-links","title":"纽结与链环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/foundations/knots-links","wordCount":1632,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"纽结与链环\">纽结与链环</h1><p>日常说「这两个结是一样的」时，我们其实没说清「结」是什么、「一样」又是什么。数学要的是不留缝隙的定义。一个纽结，正式地说，是圆周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到三维球面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的一个嵌入，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.1111em\"/><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0.17em\"></mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>↪</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\colon S^1 \\hookrightarrow S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8251em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，或者更常用它的像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = K(S^1) \\subset S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（即三维欧氏空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再加一个无穷远点）而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是为了让定理更干净，但对绝大多数直觉而言把它想成普通三维空间里的一条闭合曲线即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇是整章的地基，先把贯穿全 hub 的基本词汇定死：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>纽结</strong>：圆周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到三维球面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.1111em\"/><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0.17em\"></mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>↪</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\colon S^1 \\hookrightarrow S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8251em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即一条不自交的闭曲线。</li>\n<li><strong>驯顺 / 狂野</strong>：能用有限折线（或分段光滑嵌入）表示的是驯顺纽结，否则是病态的狂野纽结；本 hub 只研究驯顺情形。</li>\n<li><strong>纽结图</strong>：纽结到平面的正则投影，加上每个交叉的上下穿越信息——三维纽结的二维编码载体。</li>\n<li><strong>交叉数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：一个纽结所有图中交叉数的最小值。</li>\n<li><strong>链环与分量</strong>：若干互不相交闭曲线的嵌入称为链环，其中每条曲线是一个分量；纽结是分量数为 1 的特例。</li>\n<li><strong>连通和与素纽结</strong>：把两纽结首尾相接得到连通和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_1 \\# K_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；无法分解为两个非平凡连通和的非平凡纽结叫素纽结。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入-驯顺与狂野\">嵌入、驯顺与狂野</h2><p>「嵌入」要求这条曲线既不自交，也不无限地皱缩。如果不加限制，会出现病态的「狂野纽结」（wild knot）——比如在一点处缠绕出无穷多个越来越小的结，无法用有限的图表示。为排除它们，我们只研究<strong>驯顺纽结</strong>（tame knot）：能用有限段直线折线表示（多边形纽结），或等价地嵌入是分段光滑的。本 hub 以下所有内容默认纽结都是驯顺的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[圆周 S¹] --&gt;|嵌入映射| B[三维球面 S³ 中的闭曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; C{嵌入是否分段光滑}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[驯顺纽结&lt;br/&gt;可用有限纽结图表示]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[狂野纽结&lt;br/&gt;本 hub 不研究]&#10;    D --&gt; F[投影到平面得纽结图]&#10;    F --&gt; G[交叉处标注上下穿越]\">graph TD\n    A[圆周 S¹] --&gt;|嵌入映射| B[三维球面 S³ 中的闭曲线]\n    B --&gt; C{嵌入是否分段光滑}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[驯顺纽结&lt;br/&gt;可用有限纽结图表示]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[狂野纽结&lt;br/&gt;本 hub 不研究]\n    D --&gt; F[投影到平面得纽结图]\n    F --&gt; G[交叉处标注上下穿越]</pre><p>最简单的纽结是<strong>平凡结</strong>（unknot），就是一个不打结的圆圈。下一个是<strong>三叶结</strong>（trefoil），它是交叉数最小的非平凡纽结；再下一个是<strong>八字结</strong>（figure-eight knot）。「三叶结真的解不开」这件事看似显然，却需要不变量才能严格证明——最初等的证明用三着色，见<a href=\"../invariants/knot-colorings\">着色不变量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纽结图与交叉\">纽结图与交叉</h2><p>我们没法把三维曲线直接画在纸上，于是把它投影到平面，得到<strong>纽结图</strong>（knot diagram）。一般位置下投影只有有限个二重点，每个二重点叫一个<strong>交叉</strong>（crossing），并在画图时把下方穿过的那条线断开一小段，标出谁上谁下。这样一张平面图，加上每个交叉的上下信息，就完整编码了一个三维纽结。</p>\n<p>纽结图把三维问题降到二维，但同一个纽结有无穷多张不同的图。两张图何时代表同一纽结，由<a href=\"reidemeister-moves\">Reidemeister 移动</a>回答。下面这张表汇总本篇引入的核心词汇，它们贯穿整个 hub：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纽结</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>↪</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^1 \\hookrightarrow S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8251em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的嵌入像</td>\n<td>单一分量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链环</td>\n<td>若干互不相交圆周的嵌入</td>\n<td>分量数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纽结图</td>\n<td>纽结到平面的正则投影 + 上下信息</td>\n<td>二维表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有图中交叉最少者</td>\n<td>见<a href=\"../invariants/genus-crossing\">亏格与交叉数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向</td>\n<td>给曲线选一个行进方向</td>\n<td>影响符号与缠绕数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连通和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_1 \\# K_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两纽结「首尾相接」</td>\n<td>素分解的运算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定向-链环与缠绕数\">定向、链环与缠绕数</h2><p>给纽结选一个行进方向，就得到<strong>定向纽结</strong>。定向之后每个交叉有了正负号（右手法则）：所有交叉符号之和的相关量会进入许多不变量的定义。当我们把研究对象从一条曲线扩展到<strong>多条互不相交的闭曲线</strong>时，就得到<strong>链环</strong>（link），每条曲线是一个<strong>分量</strong>（component）。最简单的非平凡链环是 Hopf 链环（两个互相穿过的圆），其次是 Borromean 环——三个圆，任意两个都不相扣，但三个整体扣在一起，2025 年微软正是用时空中的 Borromean 环演示任意子编织（见<a href=\"../practice/knots-in-physics\">物理与量子不变量</a>）。</p>\n<p>两个定向分量之间的<strong>缠绕数</strong>（linking number）是最早的链环不变量之一：数它们图上一个分量穿过另一个分量的带符号交叉次数再除以 2。它是整数，且在 Reidemeister 移动下不变，因此能证明 Hopf 链环不能拆成两个分离的圆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"素纽结与连通和\">素纽结与连通和</h2><p>纽结之间可以做「乘法」：把两个纽结各剪开一小段、首尾对接，得到<strong>连通和</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_1 \\# K_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。如果一个非平凡纽结无法写成两个非平凡纽结的连通和，就叫<strong>素纽结</strong>（prime knot）。这与整数的素因子分解高度类似——事实上 Schubert 在 1949 年证明了纽结的<strong>唯一素分解定理</strong>：每个纽结都能唯一地（不计顺序）分解为有限个素纽结的连通和。</p>\n<p>正因如此，所有纽结表（如经典的 Rolfsen 表，以及今天的在线数据库 KnotInfo）都只列素纽结：交叉数 3 的只有三叶结，交叉数 4 的只有八字结，交叉数 5 有两个，到交叉数 16 时素纽结已超过 170 万个（这正是 DeepMind 机器学习实验所用的规模，见<a href=\"../practice/computational-knot\">计算纽结理论</a>）。复合纽结只要把素的拼起来即可，无需单独列出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纽结是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>↪</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^1 \\hookrightarrow S^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8251em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的嵌入；只研究分段光滑的「驯顺」纽结，排除病态的狂野纽结。</li>\n<li>把三维曲线投影到平面并标注交叉上下，得到纽结图——这是后续一切计算的载体。</li>\n<li>链环是多分量推广；缠绕数是衡量分量互锁的整数不变量。</li>\n<li>连通和给出纽结的「乘法」，Schubert 唯一素分解定理保证每个纽结唯一分解为素纽结，故纽结表只列素纽结。</li>\n<li>本篇定下的术语（图、交叉、定向、素、连通和）是全 hub 的公共词汇。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>这些图什么时候代表同一纽结：<a href=\"reidemeister-moves\">Reidemeister 移动</a></li>\n<li>为什么三叶结确实非平凡：<a href=\"../invariants/knot-colorings\">着色不变量</a></li>\n<li>交叉数的严格定义与计算：<a href=\"../invariants/genus-crossing\">亏格与交叉数</a></li>\n<li>跨库：嵌入与同胚这些底层概念见<a href=\"../../topology-intro/continuity-homeomorphism/continuous-maps\">拓扑入门 · 连续映射</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"纽结与链环","id":"纽结与链环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入、驯顺与狂野","id":"嵌入-驯顺与狂野"},{"level":2,"text":"纽结图与交叉","id":"纽结图与交叉"},{"level":2,"text":"定向、链环与缠绕数","id":"定向-链环与缠绕数"},{"level":2,"text":"素纽结与连通和","id":"素纽结与连通和"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何纽结理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/foundations/why-knot-theory"},"next":{"title":"Reidemeister 移动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/foundations/reidemeister-moves"}}